    <!--
      ── Three more reading washes ──────────────────────────────────────────
      Every wash is a complete palette of the same ten roles, so switching one repaints the
      whole screen (page, header, chips, ayah markers, prostration markers) in place.
      Parchment and olive are light washes; emerald and midnight are the two deep ones beside
      night. Names keep the roles the code uses (green/greenDark/softGreen) even where the wash
      itself is sepia or blue: greenDark is always the chip's ink on its softGreen chip.
